---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="Privacy Policy for Promote Waipu — how we collect, use and protect your information."
>

  <div class="page-header">
    <div class="container">
      <h1 class="fw-bold">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p>How we collect, use and protect your information</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="container py-5" style="max-width: 780px">

    <p class="text-muted small">Last updated: June 2026</p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4 mb-3">Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      Promote Waipu (Waipu Business and Community Inc) is a non-profit community group
      based in Waipu, Northland, New Zealand. Our website is
      <strong>www.promotewaipu.co.nz</strong>.
    </p>
    <p>
      Questions about this policy can be directed to
      <a href="mailto:hello@promotewaipu.co.nz">hello@promotewaipu.co.nz</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4 mb-3">Information we collect</h2>
    <p>We only collect personal information when you choose to provide it, such as when you:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Submit an enquiry via our contact form</li>
      <li>Apply for membership</li>
      <li>Submit a business directory listing</li>
      <li>Subscribe to our newsletter</li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Information collected may include your name, email address, phone number and
      business details. We do not collect this information automatically or through cookies.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4 mb-3">How we use your information</h2>
    <p>We use the information you provide only to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Respond to your enquiry</li>
      <li>Process your membership application or directory listing</li>
      <li>Send you newsletters or updates you have opted into</li>
      <li>Maintain our business directory (with your permission)</li>
    </ul>
    <p>We will never sell, rent or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4 mb-3">Third-party services</h2>
    <p>Our website uses the following third-party services:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Formspree</strong> — processes form submissions. Their privacy policy applies to data submitted via our forms.</li>
      <li><strong>Mailchimp</strong> — manages newsletter subscriptions if you choose to subscribe.</li>
      <li><strong>Bootstrap / Bootswatch CDN</strong> — delivers styling assets. No personal data is collected.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4 mb-3">Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      Under the New Zealand Privacy Act 2020, you have the right to access and correct
      personal information we hold about you. To make a request, email
      <a href="mailto:hello@promotewaipu.co.nz">hello@promotewaipu.co.nz</a>.
    </p>

    <h2 class="h4 mt-4 mb-3">Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>
      We may update this policy from time to time. The current version will always be
      available on this page.
    </p>

    <div class="card border-0 bg-sand rounded-3 p-4 mt-5">
      <p class="mb-0">
        <strong>Questions?</strong> Contact us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@promotewaipu.co.nz">hello@promotewaipu.co.nz</a>
        or visit our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Base>
